  "[silence] (to Wang Lung) the second son says nothing.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Tell me about your new wife---is she fair?\"",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"We have no end of money and I have bought her silk gowns and jade earrings---we have no end of money,\"",
  "[action] Eldest son smiles",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"And so I have, and a better wife you have never had, and I do not ask you to give me a penny from your pocket---I am well able to do it for myself,\"",
